### VietPay — Card top-up flow (payment-gateway + simulated Visa/Mastercard)
### Run `login` first; requests read tokens/ids inline from prior responses.
###
### Flow: POST /payments/topups -> gateway authorizes+captures with the acquirer
### -> acquirer fires an async settlement webhook -> gateway emits PaymentCaptured
### on Kafka -> wallet-service posts DEBIT card_clearing / CREDIT wallet. So the
### wallet balance rises a moment AFTER the topup returns (settlement is async).

@baseUrl = http://localhost
@email = test2@vietpay.dev
@password = Password123!

# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

### Create a USD wallet to top up
# @name wallet
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/wallets
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "currency": "USD" }

### Top up $10.00 with a Visa test card (BIN 411111 is on the allowlist) -> 201
# @name topup
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/topups
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: 44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletId": "{{wallet.response.body.id}}",
  "amount": "10.00",
  "currency": "USD",
  "scheme": "VISA",
  "cardToken": "tok_visa_test",
  "bin": "411111"
}

### Retry SAME request with SAME key -> idempotent, no second charge (replay)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/topups
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: 44444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletId": "{{wallet.response.body.id}}",
  "amount": "10.00",
  "currency": "USD",
  "scheme": "VISA",
  "cardToken": "tok_visa_test",
  "bin": "411111"
}

### After a ~1.5s settlement delay, the wallet is credited (DEBIT card_clearing).
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/wallets/{{wallet.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### History shows a PAYMENT-sourced CREDIT (sourceType=PAYMENT, sourceRef=paymentId)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/wallets/{{wallet.response.body.id}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Disallowed BIN -> acquirer declines -> 422
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/topups
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: 55555555-5555-5555-5555-555555555555
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletId": "{{wallet.response.body.id}}",
  "amount": "10.00",
  "currency": "USD",
  "scheme": "VISA",
  "cardToken": "tok_visa_bad",
  "bin": "999999"
}

### Mastercard top-up $5.00 (BIN 555555 on the MC allowlist) -> 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/topups
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: 66666666-6666-6666-6666-666666666666
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletId": "{{wallet.response.body.id}}",
  "amount": "5.00",
  "currency": "USD",
  "scheme": "MASTERCARD",
  "cardToken": "tok_mc_test",
  "bin": "555555"
}
